  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 301.20 Incidental repair installation and maintenance of plumbing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 301.20 “Incidental repair installation and maintenance of plumbing” means a job of minor consequence which occurs by chance and not requiring calculations or permits and inspections as mandated pursuant to NH RSA 155-A:2\n\nSource. #10847, eff 7-1-15",
